            "t": "text",
            "v": "★ Do fish sleep?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Fish swim all day long. They must get really tired, and they may want to get some “"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "shut-eye",
            "zh": "睡觉"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ".” Most fish, however, have no "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "eyelids",
            "zh": "眼皮"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". So do they really sleep? Most of them do sleep, but it’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to tell "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "whether",
            "zh": "是否"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " they’re sleeping or not."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h2",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "★ How do fish sleep?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Fish live in the water, so they don’t "
