            "v": "important",
            "ref": "v-important"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". If we do not get enough sleep, we get tired and "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". This is because when we sleep, the body can "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " itself of "
